## 5. 块的消费者

### 5a. x-loading（主要消费者，Runtime 指令）

**文件**: `E:\Work\Code\sources\autostore\packages\template\src\directives\presets\loading.ts`

x-loading 是**运行时指令**（`static override readonly kind = DirectiveKind.Runtime`），通过 `engine.getBlock(el, name)` 消费块。

**取块逻辑 `_resolveLoadingBlock()`（行 454-467）**:

```typescript
private _resolveLoadingBlock(): HTMLElement {
    if (this.el) {
        const custom = this.engine.getBlock(this.el, "loading");
        if (custom) return custom;
    }
    // DEFAULT_BLOCK 字符串 → 解析取单根元素
    const frag = parseHtmlFragment(DEFAULT_BLOCK);
    const root = (frag?.firstElementChild as HTMLElement | null) ?? null;
    if (root) return root;
    // 兜底（DEFAULT_BLOCK 解析失败，理论上不可达）
    const fallback = document.createElement("div");
    fallback.className = OVERLAY_CLASS;
    return fallback;
}
```

**编译挂载 `mountOverlay()`（行 417-446）**:

```typescript
private mountOverlay(): void {
    if (this.overlay) return;
    const target = this.resolveTarget();
    if (!target) return;
    // 取块快照：自定义 loading 块（沿宿主 scope 链就近 + 全局兜底），未命中用 DEFAULT_BLOCK
    const snapshot = this._resolveLoadingBlock();
    const clone = snapshot.cloneNode(true) as HTMLElement;
    // config 视图：作为块根 data 在 compile 前注入
    const initialData = this._configData();
    const parentScope = this.engine.findScopeByEl(this.el!) ?? null;
    const compiled = this.engine.compiler.compileChild(
        clone,
        parentScope,
        {},
        undefined,
        initialData,
    );
    const overlay = compiled.el;
    this.blockScope = compiled.scope;
    this._applyShellStyle(overlay);
    target.appendChild(overlay);
    this.overlay = overlay;
}
```

**DEFAULT_BLOCK 模板（行 106-111）**:

```typescript
const DEFAULT_BLOCK = `<div class="${OVERLAY_CLASS}">
  <div class="${BOX_CLASS}">
    <div class="${LOADER_CLASS}" :style="{color}"></div>
    <div class="${MESSAGE_CLASS}" x-text="message"></div>
  </div>
</div>`;
```

**生命周期清理 `_teardown()`（行 298-325）**: 销毁 blockScope、清 watcher、清 delayTimer、移除 overlay DOM，并手动删除 `_scopes[id]` 响应式域。

### 5b. x-empty（for.ts 里的 special 消费）

**文件**: `E:\Work\Code\sources\autostore\packages\template\src\directives\presets\for.ts`

注意：`x-empty` **不通过 getBlock 消费 x-block**，而是 x-for 容器内的特殊子节点机制（`SPECIAL_CHILDREN` 描述符表，行 109-128）:

```typescript
private static readonly SPECIAL_CHILDREN: ReadonlyArray<{
    name: string;
    match: string;
    when: (rawItems: any) => boolean;
    priority: number;
}> = [
    {
        name: "empty",
        match: "x-empty",
        when: (raw) => Array.isArray(raw) && raw.length === 0,
        // ...
    },
